      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-133990",
      ":question/problem": "There is a correlation between \"the speed of a windmill's blades\" and \"the strength of the wind.\" Which of the following is most likely true?\n\n1. An increase in the speed of a windmill's blades causes an increase in the strength of the wind.\n2. An increase in the strength of the wind causes an increase in the speed of a windmill's blades.\n3. The strength of the wind and the amount of grain milled are both factors that influence the speed of the windmill's blades."
